<h3>Catechist's Prayer</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus, who sanctified the waters of the Jordan<br />
and called me to teach the faith,<br />
help me to communicate the gift of Baptism<br />
with clarity and love.<br />
May my students understand<br />
that they are truly children of God,<br />
washed in the blood of the Lamb,<br />
and called to live in newness of life.<br />
Give me wisdom to answer difficult questions<br />
and patience to guide each soul<br />
into the waters of rebirth.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

